### REST API TESTS

### 1. Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/health

### 2. Get All Hotels
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rest/hotels

### 3. Get Rooms by Hotel ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rest/rooms?hotelId=hotel_1

### 4. Get All Bookings
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rest/bookings

### 5. Create Booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rest/bookings
content-type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "room_1",
  "guestName": "John Doe",
  "checkIn": "2026-03-15",
  "checkOut": "2026-03-18"
}

### 6. Create Another Booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rest/bookings
content-type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "room_2",
  "guestName": "Jane Smith",
  "checkIn": "2026-03-16",
  "checkOut": "2026-03-20"
}

### 7. Create Booking with Invalid Data (should fail - too short)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rest/bookings
content-type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "r",
  "guestName": "A",
  "checkIn": "2026-03-15",
  "checkOut": "2026-03-18"
}

### GRAPHQL TESTS

### 8. GraphQL - Get All Hotels with Cities
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetHotels { hotels { id name city } }"
}

### 9. GraphQL - Get Hotel with Rooms
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetHotelWithRooms { hotel(id: \"hotel_1\") { id name city rooms { id name capacity pricePerNight } } }"
}

### 10. GraphQL - Get Rooms for Hotel
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetRooms { rooms(hotelId: \"hotel_1\") { id name capacity pricePerNight isAvailable } }"
}

### 11. GraphQL - Get Room with Availability (no dates)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetRoom { room(id: \"room_1\") { id name capacity pricePerNight isAvailable } }"
}

### 12. GraphQL - Get Room Availability (specific dates)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetRoomAvailability { room(id: \"room_1\") { id name isAvailable(checkIn: \"2026-03-15\", checkOut: \"2026-03-18\") } }"
}

### 13. GraphQL - Get Bookings for Room
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetBookings { bookings(roomId: \"room_1\") { id roomId checkIn checkOut status room { id name } } }"
}

### 14. GraphQL - Create Booking Mutation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation CreateBooking { createBooking(roomId: \"room_3\", checkIn: \"2026-03-21\", checkOut: \"2026-03-23\") { id roomId checkIn checkOut status } }"
}

### 15. GraphQL - Get Single Booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "query GetBooking { booking(id: \"booking_1\") { id roomId checkIn checkOut status room { id name } } }"
}

### 16. GraphQL - Confirm Booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation ConfirmBooking { confirmBooking(bookingId: \"booking_1\") }"
}

### 17. GraphQL - Cancel Booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/graphql
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation CancelBooking { cancelBooking(bookingId: \"booking_1\") }"
}